<title>FRANCE: Teachers stage strike in northeastern Algeria.</title>
<headline>Teachers stage strike in northeastern Algeria.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1996-10-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Teachers in Algeria's northeastern Tizi-Ouzou region walked out of schools on Sunday to protest against an education budget cut which led to many teachers been laid off in the area, Algerian state-run radio said.</p>
<p>The radio said the strike was massively followed by teachers in primary, intermediate and secondary schools.</p>
</text>
